   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Strategic targets for the Branch Office for 2016 – 2017:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": true,
   "items": [
    "Improve legal status of the Branch Office;",
    "Further improvement of corporate management systems reflecting strategic development plan of Head Office and advanced international practice in accordance with the legislation of Azerbaijan Republic;",
    "Fully adapt customer services to the principles of “customer satisfaction” by reconstructing marketing and sales activities;",
    "Further improve the activities related to information technologies and data streams;",
    "Improve financial management;",
    "Increase the high – quality level location of credit portfolio on a growing line."
